{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_34","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"nl -ba .task-board/.resources/TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_external-build-repositories-architecture-v5.md | sed -n '1200,1465p'\"","aggregated_output":"  1200\t  },\n  1201\t  {\n  1202\t    \"name\": \"nonempty-size-zero-is-deliberately-noncanonical\",\n  1203\t    \"bytes_utf8\": \"version https://git-lfs.github.com/spec/v1\\noid sha256:aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa\\nsize 0\\n\",\n  1204\t    \"expected_error\": \"build_repository_git_lfs_unsupported\",\n  1205\t    \"classification\": \"legacy-or-noncanonical\",\n  1206\t    \"git_lfs_3_7_1_strict_exit\": 2\n  1207\t  },\n  1208\t  {\n  1209\t    \"name\": \"cutoff-1023-after-trim\",\n  1210\t    \"construction\": {\n  1211\t      \"prefix_utf8\": \"version https://git-lfs.github.com/spec/v1\\noid sha256:aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa\\nsize 1\\n\",\n  1212\t      \"pad_byte_hex\": \"20\",\n  1213\t      \"total_bytes\": 1023\n  1214\t    },\n  1215\t    \"expected_error\": \"build_repository_git_lfs_unsupported\",\n  1216\t    \"classification\": \"legacy-or-noncanonical\"\n  1217\t  },\n  1218\t  {\n  1219\t    \"name\": \"cutoff-1024-is-ordinary\",\n  1220\t    \"construction\": {\n  1221\t      \"prefix_utf8\": \"version https://git-lfs.github.com/spec/v1\\noid sha256:aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa\\nsize 1\\n\",\n  1222\t      \"pad_byte_hex\": \"20\",\n  1223\t      \"total_bytes\": 1024\n  1224\t    },\n  1225\t    \"expected\": \"ordinary-blob\"\n  1226\t  },\n  1227\t  {\n  1228\t    \"name\": \"near-miss-extension-starts-with-punctuation\",\n  1229\t    \"bytes_utf8\": \"version https://git-lfs.github.com/spec/v1\\next-1-!a sha256:bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb\\noid sha256:aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa\\nsize 1\\n\",\n  1230\t    \"expected\": \"ordinary-blob\"\n  1231\t  },\n  1232\t  {\n  1233\t    \"name\": \"near-miss-uppercase-oid\",\n  1234\t    \"bytes_utf8\": \"version https://git-lfs.github.com/spec/v1\\noid sha256:AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\\nsize 1\\n\",\n  1235\t    \"expected\": \"ordinary-blob\"\n  1236\t  }\n  1237\t]\n  1238\t```\n  1239\t\n  1240\tNo audit or artifact-cache lookup begins until the object proof, LFS scan,\n  1241\tmaterialization, whole-snapshot validation, and\n  1242\t`curator-build-source-v1` digest succeed. Object bytes are transport input, not\n  1243\tprovenance, and the object store is never agent-facing, runtime-copied, or used\n  1244\tdirectly as build source.\n  1245\t\n  1246\t## 7. Snapshot identity and audit equivalence\n  1247\t\n  1248\tThe consuming skill snapshot and each effective external repository snapshot are independent untrusted audit subjects.\n  1249\t\n  1250\tFor every external repository selected by the active plan:\n  1251\t\n  1252\t1. validate the whole repository snapshot;\n  1253\t2. compute `curator-build-source-v1` over every regular file, including `curator-build.json` and files outside the selected build root;\n  1254\t3. parse the descriptor and select the target;\n  1255\t4. audit the complete external snapshot under declared/effective identity, object format, effective commit, build-source digest, target, and substitution state;\n  1256\t5. apply allowlist, revocation, registry, tag-lock, and audit policy gates;\n  1257\t6. only then inspect an artifact-cache candidate or start a compiler child.\n  1258\t\n  1259\tRegistry evidence for the skill does not attest the external repository. External evidence does not attest the skill. Audit cache reuse is allowed only when its subject tuple exactly matches the declared/effective state and snapshot digest; it does not bypass snapshot admission.\n  1260\t\n  1261\tA syntax-only offline check that cannot obtain an exact protected snapshot warns `build_repository_unverified_offline` and makes no source/audit/build claim. Install, update, repair, and coverage-claiming audit fail before mutation when the exact effective snapshot cannot be obtained and audited.\n  1262\t\n  1263\tDry-run may use network and removable operation-private fetch state, but it leaves no persistent repository, snapshot, audit response, lock, receipt, marker, or cache mutation. It must validate and audit the exact snapshot before reporting cache-hit or would-build.\n  1264\t\n  1265\t## 8. Receipt v2, cache identity, and mixed schema-7 builds\n  1266\t\n  1267\t### 8.1 Unsubstituted external receipt input\n  1268\t\n  1269\tReceipt-v2 input binds the complete source state:\n  1270\t\n  1271\t```json\n  1272\t{\n  1273\t  \"schema_version\": 2,\n  1274\t  \"driver\": \"go-repository-v1\",\n  1275\t  \"source\": {\n  1276\t    \"repository\": \"golden-tools\",\n  1277\t    \"declared\": {\n  1278\t      \"identity\": {\n  1279\t        \"kind\": \"network-git\",\n  1280\t        \"value\": \"github.com/example/golden-tools\"\n  1281\t      },\n  1282\t      \"transport\": \"https\",\n  1283\t      \"locked_commit\": {\n  1284\t        \"object_format\": \"sha1\",\n  1285\t        \"hex\": \"0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567\"\n  1286\t      },\n  1287\t      \"tag\": \"v1.4.0\"\n  1288\t    },\n  1289\t    \"effective\": {\n  1290\t      \"identity\": {\n  1291\t        \"kind\": \"network-git\",\n  1292\t        \"value\": \"github.com/example/golden-tools\"\n  1293\t      },\n  1294\t      \"transport\": \"https\",\n  1295\t      \"object_format\": \"sha1\",\n  1296\t      \"commit\": \"0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567\",\n  1297\t      \"substituted\": false,\n  1298\t      \"build_source\": {\n  1299\t        \"algorithm\": \"curator-build-source-v1\",\n  1300\t        \"content_sha256\": \"sha256:bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb\"\n  1301\t      }\n  1302\t    },\n  1303\t    \"descriptor\": {\n  1304\t      \"path\": \"curator-build.json\",\n  1305\t      \"target\": \"golden-tool\"\n  1306\t    }\n  1307\t  },\n  1308\t  \"command\": \"golden-tool\",\n  1309\t  \"build_root\": \".\",\n  1310\t  \"source_dir\": \"cmd/golden-tool\",\n  1311\t  \"target\": {\n  1312\t    \"goos\": \"darwin\",\n  1313\t    \"goarch\": \"arm64\",\n  1314\t    \"tuning\": {\n  1315\t      \"GOARM64\": \"v8.0\"\n  1316\t    }\n  1317\t  },\n  1318\t  \"toolchain\": {\n  1319\t    \"algorithm\": \"curator-go-toolchain-v1\",\n  1320\t    \"go_relpath\": \"bin/go\",\n  1321\t    \"go_version\": \"go version go1.26.1 darwin/arm64\",\n  1322\t    \"content_sha256\": \"sha256:cccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccc\"\n  1323\t  },\n  1324\t  \"policy\": {\n  1325\t    \"module_mode\": \"vendor\",\n  1326\t    \"network\": \"none\",\n  1327\t    \"workspace\": false,\n  1328\t    \"cgo\": false,\n  1329\t    \"compiler_directives\": \"reject-nonstandard-cgo-import-dynamic-v1\",\n  1330\t    \"target_mode\": \"native\",\n  1331\t    \"link_mode\": \"internal\",\n  1332\t    \"libgcc\": \"none\",\n  1333\t    \"package_assembly\": false,\n  1334\t    \"host_objects\": false,\n  1335\t    \"telemetry\": \"off-private\",\n  1336\t    \"source_kind\": \"locked-external-git-v1\"\n  1337\t  }\n  1338\t}\n  1339\t```\n  1340\t\n  1341\t### 8.2 Substituted external receipt input\n  1342\t\n  1343\tOnly the source portion changes for a local substitution:\n  1344\t\n  1345\t```json\n  1346\t{\n  1347\t  \"repository\": \"golden-tools\",\n  1348\t  \"declared\": {\n  1349\t    \"identity\": {\n  1350\t      \"kind\": \"network-git\",\n  1351\t      \"value\": \"github.com/example/golden-tools\"\n  1352\t    },\n  1353\t    \"transport\": \"https\",\n  1354\t    \"locked_commit\": {\n  1355\t      \"object_format\": \"sha1\",\n  1356\t      \"hex\": \"0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567\"\n  1357\t    },\n  1358\t    \"tag\": \"v1.4.0\"\n  1359\t  },\n  1360\t  \"effective\": {\n  1361\t    \"identity\": {\n  1362\t      \"kind\": \"operator-local-git\",\n  1363\t      \"value\": \"sha256:eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee\"\n  1364\t    },\n  1365\t    \"object_format\": \"sha1\",\n  1366\t    \"commit\": \"89abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef\",\n  1367\t    \"substituted\": true,\n  1368\t    \"substitution\": {\n  1369\t      \"type\": \"local-path\"\n  1370\t    },\n  1371\t    \"build_source\": {\n  1372\t      \"algorithm\": \"curator-build-source-v1\",\n  1373\t      \"content_sha256\": \"sha256:ffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffff\"\n  1374\t    }\n  1375\t  },\n  1376\t  \"descriptor\": {\n  1377\t    \"path\": \"curator-build.json\",\n  1378\t    \"target\": \"golden-tool\"\n  1379\t  }\n  1380\t}\n  1381\t```\n  1382\t\n  1383\tA network substitution instead uses `identity.kind: \"network-git\"`, its canonical value and transport, and `substitution: {\"type\":\"network-git\",\"ref\":<structured-ref>}`.\n  1384\t\n  1385\tThe complete receipt-v2 input is canonicalized with CCJ-1. Its SHA-256 is the artifact cache key. The key therefore cannot describe declared provenance while compiling substituted bytes.\n  1386\t\n  1387\tReceipt v2 retains exact canonical stored bytes, manager-derived artifact path, artifact SHA-256, and byte size. It has no trust/provenance boolean. Protected-state admission remains out of band.\n  1388\t\n  1389\t### 8.3 Mixed command behavior\n  1390\t\n  1391\tOne schema-7 installation may contain both command kinds:\n  1392\t\n  1393\t- local `go-v1` commands keep receipt v1 and the consuming skill's raw `build_source`;\n  1394\t- external `go-repository-v1` commands use receipt v2 and per-command external source state;\n  1395\t- the two drivers never share receipt interpretation or logical cache keys;\n  1396\t- marker v3 represents both simultaneously;\n  1397\t- top-level marker `build_source` is present exactly when at least one active local `go-v1` command exists and retains schema-6 meaning;\n  1398\t- external-only installations omit top-level skill `build_source`; each external build entry carries its source identity and digest.\n  1399\t\n  1400\tNo field is inferred from a driver name when parsing a receipt or marker; schemas use explicit conditional branches.\n  1401\t\n  1402\t## 9. Marker v3, status, repair, deduplication, and GC\n  1403\t\n  1404\tIllustrative mixed marker excerpt:\n  1405\t\n  1406\t```json\n  1407\t{\n  1408\t  \"schema_version\": 3,\n  1409\t  \"skill_schema_version\": 7,\n  1410\t  \"build_source\": {\n  1411\t    \"algorithm\": \"curator-build-source-v1\",\n  1412\t    \"content_sha256\": \"sha256:aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa\"\n  1413\t  },\n  1414\t  \"build_roots\": [\n  1415\t    \"build\"\n  1416\t  ],\n  1417\t  \"builds\": {\n  1418\t    \"local-helper\": {\n  1419\t      \"driver\": \"go-v1\",\n  1420\t      \"receipt_schema_version\": 1,\n  1421\t      \"cache_key\": \"sha256:1111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111\",\n  1422\t      \"receipt_sha256\": \"sha256:2222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222\",\n  1423\t      \"artifact_sha256\": \"sha256:3333333333333333333333333333333333333333333333333333333333333333\",\n  1424\t      \"artifact_path\": \"bin/local-helper\"\n  1425\t    },\n  1426\t    \"golden-tool\": {\n  1427\t      \"driver\": \"go-repository-v1\",\n  1428\t      \"receipt_schema_version\": 2,\n  1429\t      \"repository\": \"golden-tools\",\n  1430\t      \"declared_identity\": {\n  1431\t        \"kind\": \"network-git\",\n  1432\t        \"value\": \"github.com/example/golden-tools\"\n  1433\t      },\n  1434\t      \"declared_locked_commit\": {\n  1435\t        \"object_format\": \"sha1\",\n  1436\t        \"hex\": \"0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567\"\n  1437\t      },\n  1438\t      \"declared_tag\": \"v1.4.0\",\n  1439\t      \"effective_identity\": {\n  1440\t        \"kind\": \"network-git\",\n  1441\t        \"value\": \"github.com/example/golden-tools\"\n  1442\t      },\n  1443\t      \"object_format\": \"sha1\",\n  1444\t      \"commit\": \"0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567\",\n  1445\t      \"substituted\": false,\n  1446\t      \"build_source\": {\n  1447\t        \"algorithm\": \"curator-build-source-v1\",\n  1448\t        \"content_sha256\": \"sha256:bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb\"\n  1449\t      },\n  1450\t      \"descriptor_target\": \"golden-tool\",\n  1451\t      \"cache_key\": \"sha256:4444444444444444444444444444444444444444444444444444444444444444\",\n  1452\t      \"receipt_sha256\": \"sha256:5555555555555555555555555555555555555555555555555555555555555555\",\n  1453\t      \"artifact_sha256\": \"sha256:6666666666666666666666666666666666666666666666666666666666666666\",\n  1454\t      \"artifact_path\": \"bin/golden-tool\"\n  1455\t    }\n  1456\t  }\n  1457\t}\n  1458\t```\n  1459\t\n  1460\t### 9.1 Snapshot and artifact keys\n  1461\t\n  1462\t- Protected external snapshot key: effective identity kind/value, effective object format, full effective commit, and external build-source digest.\n  1463\t- Artifact key: SHA-256 of the entire receipt input, including both declared and effective states, command key, descriptor target, build root/source directory, target, toolchain, and policy.\n  1464\t- Snapshot bytes may be deduplicated only when the complete snapshot key matches. Audit decisions remain subject-specific.\n  1465\t- Artifacts may be reused only when the complete receipt input and protected entry validate. Different declarations, substitutions, commands, targets, toolchains, or policy revisions do not alias.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
